mapping "W5371.1" source="W5371" target="37383006" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W5371 = Bitten by rat - farm area - sports/exercise. Target SNOMED CT 37383006. Athena
        crosswalk: ICD10 45756304 (W53) Maps to. Target subsumes source (mammal attack includes rat
        bite). One-level breadth mismatch with verified crosswalk. High tier. The place+activity
        modifiers in the ICD10 extension have no SNOMED CT external-cause equivalent; the injury mechanism
        (rat bite) is the mappable clinical element.
        """
}
